Z||000022||Patrick's Dad||12-23-2001||02:40 PM||||I like it, but I'm not partial to neon....<P>I also agree that it needs something to break up the black, but I'm not sure a couple of circles are the thing. How about a dark pinstripe (Maybe, purple?) above the beltline. Something subtle.<P>I'm planning the opposite, as my car is white. I'm going to paint the rubstrip, then put an opalescent stripe along the bodyline. It will be white from most angles, but change color from others. And since it will only be ¼" in width, it shouldn't be obnoxious.<P>Hmmm. White rims?||||reg||1
