Z||000024||AkursedX||12-23-2001||07:31 PM|||| <BLOCKQUOTE><font size="1" face="Verdana, Arial, Helvetica">quote:</font><HR>Originally posted by MikeSchaefer:<BR><B>I think you should take it a step more and even tint out the fastback sailpanels, <BR></B><HR></BLOCKQUOTE><P>That idea is most likely going to happen.  I just don't know when yet.  I think it would complete the look.  <P>When I first bought this car, it already had the windows tinted, so I decided that since it was going to be so dark, I might as well make the whole car black.<P>As for the black wheels, I really hope I inspired some people with this look.  I have wnted to do this for some time, because I never saw it before on a Fiero.  Except that ugly Jeff Gordon Nascar look-alike Fiero.  That car had black rims, but you really couldn't judge the look due to the ugliness of the rest of the car.<P>||||reg||1
